<title>UK: Lauda Air sets 120 million ATS five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Lauda Air sets 120 million ATS five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Creditanstalt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LAUDA AIR LUFTFAHRT AG</p>
<p> AMT    120 MLN ATS   COUPON     5.2 PCT   MATURITY    25.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE    25.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    100	 SPREAD	+51 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    VIENNA    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (M) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
